{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackin-project/jackin/pulls/1179","id":4974810468,"node_id":"PR_kwDOR2N26c8AAAABKIWVZA","html_url":"https://github.com/jackin-project/jackin/pull/1179","diff_url":"https://github.com/jackin-project/jackin/pull/1179.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jackin-project/jackin/pull/1179.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackin-project/jackin/issues/1179","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackin-project/jackin/pulls/1179/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackin-project/jackin/pulls/1179/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackin-project/jackin/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackin-project/jackin/issues/1179/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackin-project/jackin/statuses/ea9238fcf2892578ddd23d6f283038ea269bd14a","number":1179,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(release)!: adopt velnor-actions 0.1.40 immutable previews","user":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nRegenerates CI with velnor-actions **0.1.40** and migrates Jackin's preview consumption to the immutable per-source model from tailrocks/velnor-new#341. Follow-up to #1173 and #1176.\n\n### velnor-actions 0.1.40 verification\n- `velnor-actions-0.1.40-aarch64-apple-darwin` sha256 `04b72a22c4ee61eacdc272c866a8baeb5eaa895d2f9ac6bb43845921a3b76347` matches the release `.sha256` and `release-manifest.json`.\n- `gh attestation verify -R tailrocks/velnor-new`: exit 0 for the binary and the manifest. Signer `product-release-generator.yml@refs/heads/main`, source digest `3118a34c13481a4a303af7ad51464a614d42962b`, which is tag `v0.1.40`.\n- The manifest reports version `0.1.40` and commit `3118a34c`, and contains #341 (`9a0b9d2f`) and #350 (`76b4de2d`).\n- `.velnor/release-manifest.json` is the published manifest committed byte-identical (`cmp`). `.github/` is regenerated only with `velnor-actions generate`.\n\n### Configuration\n- Removes preview `release_id` and `bootstrap_snapshot_sha256`, which 0.1.40 rejects.\n- Sets `crate_timeout_minutes` back from 20 to **10**. 0.1.40 gives the dependency seed its own budget. The new config declares `dependency_seed_timeout_minutes = 30` explicitly; this equals the default and the generated output is byte-identical. Evidence: in main CI runs 39853340458 and 39837715622, crate jobs peaked at 6.1 and 7.1 min (under 10), and the seed took 14.2 and 9.6 min (under 30).\n\n### Product migration (`jackin-image`)\n- `velnor-actions-contract` moves from 0.1.38 to **0.1.40** (`3118a34c`). The 0.1.38 contract requires tag `preview` and authority == source.\n- Capsule download, failure message and receipt tag use `preview-<full source SHA>`. The full SHA comes from the native build origin and must extend the version's sha7.\n- In 0.1.40, preview source **A** (the CI head) and workflow authority **B** (the `workflow_run` head) may differ:\n  - The Fulcio source digest, SLSA `resolvedDependencies` gitCommit, release run head and job heads bind **B**.\n  - The receipt, tag and CI run bind **A**.\n  - At admission, `A <= B <= main` is checked through the compare API (status, merge base, `behind_by`).\n- Freshness now requires an immutable prerelease whose body, and whose annotated tag message, equal Velnor's `velnor-package-release-recovery-v1` envelope of the exact signed receipt and bundle.\n- Removed: the rolling journal, the pinned release ID `328385904`, and acceptance of a lightweight preview tag. Stable behavior is unchanged.\n- Docs updated: installation, verifying releases, capsule reference, xtasks.\n\n### After merge (owner rulesets)\n`protect-release-tags` (25649371) drops its `refs/tags/preview` exclusion, so the frozen legacy `preview` tag also gets `update`. This only tightens. It is applied after merge so the 0.1.39 preview publisher on main is not broken first.\n\n### Not claimed\nThis PR does not claim a published immutable preview, Homebrew promotion (still disabled), or a live capsule download. Those need the first post-merge preview run. The tap formula still points at the legacy `preview` release, which stays immutable and in place.\n\n### Local verification\n- `cargo nextest run -p jackin-image`: 175/175 passed.\n- `cargo clippy -p jackin-image --all-targets -D warnings` and `cargo fmt --all --check` are clean.\n- `hk check --all` result is in a comment below. swiftlint can't run on this Mac (SourceKit missing: Command Line Tools without Xcode), and it is host-only.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-22T22:12:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:31Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:28Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:28Z","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jackin-project:ci/velnor-actions-0.1.40-immutable-preview","ref":"ci/velnor-actions-0.1.40-immutable-preview","repo":{"id":1197700841,"node_id":"R_kgDOR2N26Q","name":"jackin","full_name":"jackin-project/jackin","owner"